{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.4, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.5, [TSON-SCHEMA] §7.2 (choice subtypes, proposed for Revision 40)"
  description: """
    `!small` selects `int32` at `( int32 | text )`, and the value validates as a `small`: 11 is an `int32` and above
